This project is a Go re-implementation of RaTeX (https://github.com/erweixin/RaTeX),
which is licensed under the MIT License above. The reference/ directory contains
verbatim copies of upstream Rust sources used as porting reference, and
testdata/golden/ contains the upstream golden-test corpus. Both retain the
upstream MIT license.
